# PyPI sdist contents.
#
# Ship only the installable protocol package plus metadata (README +
# license-files are added automatically by setuptools from pyproject).
# Everything below is a GitHub-clone concern, not a pip-install concern:
#
#   - firmware/  : Pico CircuitPython code, flashed from a repo clone.
#   - docs/      : protocol spec + flash guide.
#   - examples/  : runnable smoke tests.
#   - tests/     : import firmware/ via sys.path, so they FAIL if shipped
#                  in an sdist that (correctly) excludes firmware/. Keeping
#                  them out avoids a broken `pytest` on a pip-installed copy.

# Metadata files setuptools does not auto-include (only README.md and the
# pyproject license-files are automatic):
include SECURITY.md CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md README.zh-CN.md

prune tests
prune firmware
prune docs
prune examples
